        "Langkah 5: Parameter Q-Learning\n",
        "\n",
        "Sesuai konsep Q-Learning pada PPT yang menggunakan Learning Rate (α) dan Discount Factor (γ)"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "gZl5OfQoWGPO"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "alpha = 0.8       # learning rate\n",
        "gamma = 0.95      # discount factor\n",
        "epsilon = 1.0     # exploration rate (initial value)\n",
        "\n",
        "epsilon_decay = 0.995\n",
        "min_epsilon = 0.01\n",
        "\n",
        "episodes = 2000 # Default episodes for FrozenLake example\n",
        "max_steps = 100"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "tksD8VbLWHH_"
      },
      "execution_count": 5,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
