      "source": [
        "### Inisialisasi Lingkungan Taxi-v3 dan Q-Table Baru\n",
        "\n",
        "Untuk `Tugas Lanjutan`, kita akan menginisialisasi ulang lingkungan untuk `Taxi-v3` dan menyiapkan Q-Table baru yang sesuai."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "d00a9b3f"
      },
      "source": [
        "env_taxi = gym.make(\"Taxi-v3\") # Menggunakan Taxi-v3 sesuai permintaan\n",
        "\n",
        "state_size_taxi = env_taxi.observation_space.n\n",
        "action_size_taxi = env_taxi.action_space.n\n",
        "\n",
        "q_table_taxi = np.zeros((state_size_taxi, action_size_taxi))\n",
        "\n",
        "print(f\"Jumlah State untuk Taxi-v3: {state_size_taxi}\")\n",
        "print(f\"Jumlah Action untuk Taxi-v3: {action_size_taxi}\")\n",
        "print(\"Q-Table Taxi-v3 berhasil diinisialisasi.\")"
      ],
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "c29fb30b"
      },
      "source": [
        "### Parameter Q-Learning untuk Taxi-v3\n",
        "\n",
        "Kita akan menggunakan parameter yang sama untuk Q-Learning, tetapi dengan penyesuaian jika diperlukan untuk lingkungan Taxi."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "9eeb7a6a"
      },
      "source": [
        "alpha_taxi = 0.8\n",
        "gamma_taxi = 0.95\n",
        "epsilon_taxi = 1.0\n",
        "epsilon_decay_taxi = 0.995\n",
        "min_epsilon_taxi = 0.01\n",
        "max_steps_taxi = 200 # Taxi-v3 usually requires more steps than FrozenLake"
      ],
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "ed893363"
      },
      "source": [
        "### Fungsi Pelatihan Q-Learning yang Dapat Digunakan Kembali\n",
        "\n",
        "Untuk membandingkan hasil pelatihan dengan episode yang berbeda, kita akan membuat fungsi pelatihan yang dapat menerima jumlah episode sebagai parameter."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "6d41e83a"
      },
      "source": [
        "def train_q_agent(env, q_table_init, alpha, gamma, epsilon_init, epsilon_decay, min_epsilon, episodes, max_steps, report_interval=100):\n",
        "    q_table = np.copy(q_table_init)\n",
        "    rewards_per_episode = []\n",
        "    epsilon = epsilon_init\n",
        "\n",
        "    print(f\"Memulai pelatihan untuk {episodes} episode...\")\n",
        "\n",
        "    for episode in range(episodes):\n",
        "        state, info = env.reset()\n",
        "        total_reward = 0\n",
        "\n",
        "        for step in range(max_steps):\n",
        "            if random.uniform(0, 1) < epsilon:\n",
        "                action = env.action_space.sample() # Exploration\n",
        "            else:\n",
        "                action = np.argmax(q_table[state]) # Exploitation\n",
        "\n",
        "            next_state, reward, terminated, truncated, info = env.step(action)\n",
        "\n",
        "            # Update Q-Table\n",
        "            q_table[state, action] = q_table[state, action] + alpha * (\n",
        "                reward + gamma * np.max(q_table[next_state]) - q_table[state, action]\n",
        "            )\n",
        "\n",
        "            state = next_state\n",
        "            total_reward += reward\n",
        "\n",
        "            if terminated or truncated:\n",
        "                break\n",
        "\n",
        "        # Epsilon decay\n",
        "        epsilon = max(min_epsilon, epsilon * epsilon_decay)\n",
        "        rewards_per_episode.append(total_reward)\n",
        "\n",
        "        if (episode + 1) % report_interval == 0:\n",
        "            avg_reward = np.mean(rewards_per_episode[-report_interval:])\n",
        "            print(f\"Episode {episode + 1}/{episodes}: Rata-rata reward = {avg_reward:.2f}\")\n",
        "\n",
        "    print(f\"Pelatihan selesai untuk {episodes} episode!\")\n",
        "    return q_table, rewards_per_episode"
      ],
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
